[{"answer":"Some things are different shapes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/1.mp3"},{"answer":"They can be described by their shape.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/2.mp3"},{"answer":"A circle is round.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/3.mp3"},{"answer":"A compact disc is a circle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/4.mp3"},{"answer":"A square has four equal sides.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/5.mp3"},{"answer":"A rectangle is similar,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/6.mp3"},{"answer":"but two of the sides are longer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/7.mp3"},{"answer":"A triangle has only three sides.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you ever seen anyone play a triangle in an orchestra?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The word \"triangle\" can stand for an instrument or a shape.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/10.mp3"},{"answer":"An oval is rounded, but it is not round.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/11.mp3"},{"answer":"An egg is an oval shape.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The floor is flat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/13.mp3"},{"answer":"If something is smooth, it has no bumps or lumps","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Silk is smooth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Some things are rough. Sandpaper is rough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/16.mp3"},{"answer":"If something is dull, it is not sharp or pointed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/17.mp3"},{"answer":"A dull knife will not cut bread because the blade is not sharp.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/18.mp3"},{"answer":"If something is pointed, it has a sharp end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/19.mp3"},{"answer":"A sharp pencil has a pointed end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/20.mp3"},{"answer":"A pencil that has been used a lot, and hasn't been sharpened has a dull end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Some things are soft. A teddy bear is soft. It feels good to touch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Some things are hard. A rock is hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Soft can also represent a noise level.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/24.mp3"},{"answer":"If you have a soft voice, it is not very loud.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/25.mp3"},{"answer":"If someone tells you to speak softly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/26.mp3"},{"answer":"they want you to speak quietly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/27.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Loud\" is the word used to describe noises that hurt your ears.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/28.mp3"},{"answer":"A big truck will make a loud noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes your mother will tell you that your music is too loud.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/45-describing-things-2019-03-29-10-17-39/30.mp3"}]
